  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>에<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>흐<ruby>로<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>때<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>디<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oXgvD0GOe60?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶<rt>얗ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為何<rt>위호ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>放捒<rt>방ˋ삭</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà yâh-si-bo-liâu-kâi-lì wi-hó pàng-sak’goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˋ되ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>按怎<rt>안ˆ좔ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jāi-tàu-toê-si-ân-joà̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈</rt></ruby> <ruby>照鏡<rt>죠ˋ걀</rt></ruby> <ruby>斟酌<rt>짐ˉ젹ˆ-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà siṵ-lai-siṵ-khi jiò-kia̰ jīm-jiôrk-ka-khoa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>發現<rt>홛ˆ혠ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>魂<rt>훈-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>體<rt>테ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiâh-hoât-hiēn, jit-e-bo-hun-u-thè’e goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時時刻刻<rt>시시켹ˆ켹</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>空虛<rt>캉ˉ희ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-si-khiêk-khiek goà lông-kâm-kâk-khāng-hî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>論<rt>룬-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>眠夢<rt>삔빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>清醒<rt>촁ˉ칠ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-lun-si-bin-bāng yah-si-chiēng-chḭ̀\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>請<rt>챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>身邊<rt>신ˉ빌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiâ̰-lì tǹg’lai goà’e sīn-pḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>Aphrodite<rt>에ˉ흐로ˉ때ˉ디ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lai-jò-goà’e ē-h-lō-rāi-tî\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>早<rt>자ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>仝款<rt>강콴ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâh-khâh-jà kang-khoàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>早<rt>자ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>仝款<rt>강콴ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâh-khâh-jà kang-khoàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈</rt></ruby> <ruby>照鏡<rt>죠ˋ걀</rt></ruby> <ruby>斟酌<rt>짐ˉ젹ˆ-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà siṵ-lai-siṵ-khi jiò-kia̰ jīm-jiôrk-ka-khoa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿~\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh~\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時時刻刻<rt>시시켹ˆ켹</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>空虛<rt>캉ˉ희ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-si-khiêk-khiek goà lông-kâm-kâk-khāng-hî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>論<rt>룬-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>眠夢<rt>삔빵ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>抑<rt>얗</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>清醒<rt>촁ˉ칠ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-lun-si-bin-bāng yah-si-chiēng-chḭ̀\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>請<rt>챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>身邊<rt>신ˉ빌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiâ̰-lì tǹg’lai goà’e sīn-pḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>Aphrodite<rt>에ˉ흐로ˉ때ˉ디ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lai-jò-goà’e ē-h-lō-rāi-tî\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>小姐<rt>쇼ˆ쟈ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>小姐<rt>쇼ˆ쟈ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siô-jià siô-jià\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>形影<rt>혱얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>水晶<rt>쥐ˆ질ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>內<rt>래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e hieng-yà̰ ti-jûi-jḭ̄-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>束縛<rt>석ˆ박ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiōng-goà’e sîm sôrk-pâk\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>強<rt>경-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>起痟<rt>키ˆᄉᆤˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà kiong-bêh-khî-siàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>小姐<rt>쇼ˆ쟈ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>小姐<rt>쇼ˆ쟈ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siô-jià siô-jià\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>毒液<rt>덕옉ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>注入<rt>주ˋ띱-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>身體<rt>신ˉ테ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì’e tork-yêk î-kiēng-jù-rip-goâ-sīn-thè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>強<rt>경-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>起痟<rt>키ˆᄉᆤˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà kiong-bêh-khî-siàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n"
